                    "message": "with this mentioned issue[https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/service-config-manager/+/87981/comment/c6c2979a_86c608aa/], the handler should not be wrapped in this macro, correct?\n\nIf we want to avoid triggering the deserialization logic in case of disabled persist-settings, may be we can do like below:\n\n\n```\nsignals.async_wait(sighupHandler);\n#ifdef PERSIST_SETTINGS\nreloadAllServiceConfigs(); // Call this from sighupHandler() and wrap the core logic here\n#endif\n```"
